// Reference data of MIRNA-CLASSIFY-001 MiPred tests.
//  - Hairpins: miRBase precursors (hairpin part of the RealPriMiRnas rows, MI0000077/60/70/681/88), three
//    dinucleotide shuffles of hsa-let-7a-1 that pass the package pre-judgement, and three pri-miRNAs with flanks. Structures/MFE
//    from ViennaRNA 2.8 RNA.fold; triplet counts, pre-judgement and the votes from an independent Python port of
//    microRNAcheck_parallel.pl (numpy RNG, randfold triplet-swap shuffle, 999 shuffles, ViennaRNA energies) and an independent
//    numpy traversal of the forest arrays parsed from model.RData (pure-Python reader, nothing executed).
//  - Training rows: 60 rows of train_data stored in model.RData (30 P, 30 N; first/last 15 of each class), V1..V34 as stored,
//    with the number of trees voting P from the independent numpy traversal (in-sample: every P row > 500, every N row < 500).
